      GIDClientID and the URL scheme below are BOTH placeholders — replace with the real iOS OAuth
      client ID from Google Cloud Console (Google Auth Platform -> Clients -> Create client ->
      iOS, bundle ID com.konye.historiq). The URL scheme is that same client ID's segments reversed,
      e.g. client ID "123-abc.apps.googleusercontent.com" -> scheme "com.googleusercontent.apps.123-abc".
    -->
    <key>GIDClientID</key>
    <string>REPLACE_WITH_IOS_OAUTH_CLIENT_ID.apps.googleusercontent.com</string>
    <key>CFBundleURLTypes</key>
    <array>
