          "Continue with Facebook" (Core/Auth/FacebookSignIn.ios.kt) OAuth-redirect callback —
          scheme/host must match SupabaseClient.kt's install(Auth){scheme;host}, and this same
          deep link must be added to Supabase's Auth > URL Configuration > Redirect URLs allow-list.
        -->
        <dict>
